      {
        "id": 200377,
        "name": "dpt",
        "username": "dpt",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-07-22T23:32:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Eric R\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Eric R:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>… &nbsp;Playing Land Thrashes on Turn 5 way well have been a better call? I think given Blight state at the time it'd only have gotten me 5 Fear, though, which for 4 Energy is merely OK. …</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It's effectively 1 Energy, since you would have gotten 3 from the other part of Call on Midnight's Dream (if I remember the board state correctly). Seems like a good tradeoff to me.</p>\n<p>I'm really interested to hear other comments on that playthrough.</p>",
