      {
        "id": 200378,
        "name": "cnranger",
        "username": "cnranger",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/53a042/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-07-31T16:52:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Thanks for the playthrough notes, it has helped me understand the one spirit I was having the most trouble with.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What helped</p><ul>\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp;Seeing you taking new powers on the first two turns</li>\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp;Focusing on the energy track for more energy and elements accepting that you were probably never going to play 3 cards</li>\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp;It helped me understand how the innate fear could be used to increase the defence when using the fear = defence card</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It all let to an enjoyable game where Bringer with Spread of Rampant Green ended scaring the invaders off the island in Terror level 3.</p>",
